{
  "answer": "Yes, there are special fire handling procedures required for the product. The suitable extinguishing media include water spray, alcohol-resistant foam, dry chemical or carbon dioxide. However, do NOT use water jet. Burning produces irritant fumes and may require self-contained breathing apparatus for firefighting if necessary.",
