{
  "answer": "Engineering measures: use of local exhaust over the premelting reservoir is encouraged. Personal protective equipment includes respiratory protection (in case of insufficient ventilation), hand protection with nitrile rubber gloves, eye protection with safety glasses, and heat-resistant gloves when handling hot material.",
