}

{
  "answer": "The product is a solid with off-white color, neutral odor, insoluble in water, density of 10.300 lb/gal, kinematic viscosity not applicable, and 100% solid content by weight. It does not undergo hazardous polymerization or decomposition reactions under normal conditions but can release irritating gases and vapors upon thermal decomposition.",
  "source": "Appearance, Solubility(ies), Density, Viscosity, Solid Content, % by weight"
}

{
  "answer": "The product is chemically stable, but it can be pressurized by carbon dioxide due to reaction with humid air and/or water. Hazardous polymerization does not occur, but thermal decomposition can lead to release of irritating gases and vapors.",
